calls.raw:
{
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "You lean back slightly, the chair creaking under your weight, and offer a small, easy smile. You tell her that you like her smile more than any perfect cup of coffee.",
      "type": "playerSpeech",
      "source": "I lightly flirt with Rei, telling her that I like her smile more than any perfect cup of coffee."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "dilek-sahin",
      "text": "That is a very inefficient metric. Coffee is a chemical compound. A smile is a facial expression. You are comparing a beverage to a muscle twitch.",
      "type": "npcSpeech"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "dilek-sahin",
      "text": "However. I accept the compliment. It is... less dry than the biscuits. And less soggy than the tea you brought last week.",
      "type": "npcSpeech"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "Rei’s fingers resume their quiet tapping against the armrest, a rhythmic counterpoint to the rain drumming on the windowpane. She does not look away, holding your gaze with a steady, unblinking calm that feels less like scrutiny and more like being seen.",
      "type": "narration"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "dilek-sahin",
      "text": "Since we are past the coffee critique and into the realm of... facial expressions. I have been thinking about the film. The one from 1942. The one with the long, quiet scenes where no one speaks for twenty minutes.",
      "type": "npcSpeech"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "dilek-sahin",
      "text": "I do not have a projector. But I have a very good television, and I have a box of those biscuits. The dry ones. The efficient ones. Would you like to watch it with me? It is not a date. It is a viewing. With snacks.",
      "type": "npcSpeech"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The player compliments Rei's smile, which she deflects with dry humor before accepting. Rei then invites the player to watch a 1942 film with her, clarifying it is a viewing with snacks, not a date.",
  "end_scene": false,
  "memories": [
    {
      "charKey": "dilek-sahin",
      "type": "liked",
      "desc": "The player complimented Rei's smile, which she accepted with dry humor."
    }
  ],
  "facts": [],
  "acts": [
    {
      "kind": "compliment",
      "target": "smile",
      "size": "small",
      "landed": true
    }
  ]
}

